WEBVTT

00:44:59.154 --> 00:45:01.194
is that we should all
be a little skeptical

00:45:01.218 --> 00:45:03.376
when companies claim
to be changing the world.

00:45:03.400 --> 00:45:05.083
Even if their intentions are good,

00:45:05.107 --> 00:45:07.661
sometimes they'll fall short
of their lofty ambitions.

00:45:08.118 --> 00:45:11.371
But the bigger danger
is that they'll reach those ambitions.

00:45:11.395 --> 00:45:13.309
They may well end up changing the world

00:45:13.333 --> 00:45:16.083
but that doesn't mean
they'll change it for the better.

00:45:18.406 --> 00:45:21.038
(Music)

00:45:21.062 --> 00:45:22.743
Next time on WorkLife.

00:45:22.767 --> 00:45:24.203
Arthur Brooks: It was a wreck,

00:45:24.227 --> 00:45:27.204
it was a slow moving wreck
in my career itself.

00:45:27.228 --> 00:45:28.882
I was in decline.

00:45:28.906 --> 00:45:31.193
AG: Is career decline inevitable?